<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">  Draws the length scale \`rho_iso\`, each truncated below at the floor \`rho_floor\` the basis resolves, the marginal scale \`sigma\` and standardized basis</span></span>
